<h1>Your Flickr User Claim Has Been Approved!</h1>

<p>
  Good news! Your request to claim the Flickr user <strong><%= h @flickr_user.username %></strong> has been approved.
</p>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Flickr Username:</strong> <%= h @flickr_user.username %></li>
  <li><strong>Flickr Profile:</strong> <a href="<%= h @flickr_user.profileurl %>"><%= h @flickr_user.profileurl %></a></li>
</ul>

<% if @claim&.automatic? %>
<p>
  You can now remove the verification code from your Flickr profile description.
</p>
<% end %>

<p>
  Your friendly Photonia bot.
</p>
